        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWFON, Newport Rosette With Fontainebleau Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe exquisite Newport Rosette With Crystal Fontainebleau Knob is indeed beautiful. This scalloped clear crystal knobset is a great way to add old world allure to any home. The crystal knob is a sparkling reminder of the old world; and when paired with the simple rope rose, the beauty of this crystal door knob is allowed to shine as the main focus. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWFON Newport Rosette With Crystal Fontainebleau Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Newport Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Fontainebleau Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Rosette With Fontainebleau Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Fontainebleau Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Fontainebleau Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWFON-specifications.pdf?v=1704262183\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur NEWFON Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Newport Rosette With Crystal Fontainebleau Knob, Grandeur NEWFON",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWFON, Newport Rosette With Fontainebleau Knob - The exquisite Newport Rosette With Crystal Fontainebleau Knob is indeed beautiful. This scalloped clear crystal knobset is a great way to add old world allure to any home. The crystal knob is a sparkling reminder of the old world; and when paired with the simple rope rose, the beauty of this crystal door knob is allowed to shine as the main focus. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Fontainebleau Knob With Newport Roses, Fontainebleau Knob With Newport Rosettes, GRA-NEWFON, Grandeur NEWFON, glass knobs, crystal knobs, classic knobs, ornate knobs, victorian knobs, Grandeur Newport series, Newport Rosette With Fontainebleau Knobs, Newport Rosette With Crystal Fontainebleau Knobs, Newport Rosette With Fontainebleau Knobs,"
